  "releaseNotes": "Unit properties that refuse no value are marked required\nBuild requested candle series with calendar bounds and accurate source updates\nLocalize public core enum captions with Display resources\nRead each day of a count-from-end window once, built candles too\nCount a count-from-end window up to its end, by the days' headers\nTake the storages' blocking readers back to ToBlockingEnumerable\nConnector: a request for orders it already holds no longer puts an order back to an older state\nSubscriptions: whoever joined a shared orders stream gets live orders once it is live\nConnector: a subscription restored by a reconnect receives data again\nConnector: a chain assigned as a whole shares the basket's id generator\nCsvExtendedInfoStorage: make the directory that is read\nHand the remote storage client's transport one message at a time\nRead storages from blocking callers without the caller's synchronization context\nFail a history request the lost connection took with it\nTell a second subscriber its hist+live subscription started\nConnect the remote storage client once for requests made at once\nUnwind the blocking waits left by the async rework and fix what it uncovered\nMark the blocking wrappers obsolete\nAdd walk-forward optimization, a market profile, three statistics and candle spread options\nMove instrument lookups and persistence to async\nLet a formula's assembly go with the block that compiled it\nKeep a basket's pending unsubscribes apart from the requests it numbers itself\nKeep sending the heartbeat on a link that only receives\nAwait security lookups instead of blocking on them\nReport the emulated account to the connector, floating profit included\nAnswer an unsubscribe that arrives after the connection ended\nAnswer the unsubscribe of a candle series that finished on its own\nKeep the storages of entities readable across runs and before the first write\nDeliver every candle that opens at the same instant as a finished one\nCheck that values do something, not merely that they travel\nProbe a connection only once it has gone quiet, and notice when it hangs up\nPersist the period a local drive holds its data types for\nTake the storage processor lock the way the codebase states it\nRetire adapter subscription ids without stranding the next one\nBound and release what storage subscriptions remember\nRemove dead extended security collection path\nCorrect derivatives and option calculations\nCorrect trading accounting risk and timing\nFix adapter routing and subscription lifecycles\nMake candle and storage processing reliable\nUpdated Ecng.Compilation to 1.0.341.\nUpdated Ecng.IO.Compression to 1.0.56.\nUpdated Ecng.Linq to 1.0.194.\nUpdated Ecng.Net to 1.0.551.\nUpdated Ecng.StringSearch to 1.0.270.",
